---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Pricing — Full Access $1.99/month | GoAustralia.co.nz" description="Get full access to all moving guides, suburb finder, full checklist and weekly newsletter for $1.99/month. Cancel anytime.">
<style is:global>
  /* ── PRICING CARDS ── */
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 44px;
  }
  .price-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .price-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--navy);
    border-width: 2.5px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,32,92,0.1);
  }
  .price-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .price-tier {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--txt3);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .price-amount {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .price-amount sup {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .price-cadence {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--txt3);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .price-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt2);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .price-includes {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .price-includes li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .price-includes li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--green-ok);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .price-includes li.dim {
    color: var(--txt3);
  }
  .price-includes li.dim::before {
    color: var(--border);
  }
  .price-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt3);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  /* ── COMPARISON TABLE ── */
  .compare-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .compare-table thead tr {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .compare-table thead th {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .compare-table thead th:not(:first-child) {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .compare-table tbody tr {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
  }
  .compare-table tbody tr:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .compare-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: var(--surf2);
  }
  .compare-table td {
    padding: 12px 18px;
    color: var(--txt2);
  }
  .compare-table td:first-child {
    color: var(--txt);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .compare-table td:not(:first-child) {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .check-yes {
    color: var(--green-ok);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .check-no {
    color: var(--border);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .compare-wrap {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 480px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .compare-table { font-size: 12px; }
    .compare-table td, .compare-table th { padding: 10px 12px; }
  }
</style>

<!-- PAGE HERO -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">← Home</a> / Pricing
    </div>
    <h1>Full Access — $1.99/month</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Everything a Kiwi needs for their Australian move. Cancel anytime, no lock-in, instant access.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING CARDS -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <p class="sec-eye">Choose a plan</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h2" style="margin:0 auto;">Simple, honest pricing</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub" style="margin: 12px auto 0;">Start free, upgrade when you're ready. No hidden fees.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-grid">

      <!-- FREE -->
      <div class="price-card reveal d1">
        <p class="price-tier">Free</p>
        <p class="price-amount">$0</p>
        <p class="price-cadence">forever</p>
        <p class="price-desc">Get a feel for the tools before you commit. Good for early research.</p>
        <ul class="price-includes">
          <li>Visa Checker (basic results)</li>
          <li>Moving Checklist (basic — 20 steps)</li>
          <li>3 blog articles per month</li>
          <li class="dim">All 3 PDF guides</li>
          <li class="dim">Full 70-step checklist</li>
          <li class="dim">Suburb Finder</li>
          <li class="dim">Unlimited blog access</li>
          <li class="dim">Weekly newsletter</li>
          <li class="dim">Priority email Q&amp;A</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/tools/visa-checker" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block">Start free →</a>
      </div>

      <!-- FULL ACCESS (featured) -->
      <div class="price-card featured reveal d2">
        <div class="price-badge">Most popular</div>
        <p class="price-tier">Full Access</p>
        <p class="price-amount"><sup>$</sup>1.99</p>
        <p class="price-cadence">per month NZD · cancel anytime</p>
        <p class="price-desc">Everything you need from the day you decide to move until the day you settle in.</p>
        <ul class="price-includes">
          <li>Everything in Free</li>
          <li>All 3 PDF guides (Masterguide, Tax &amp; Finance, Jobs)</li>
          <li>Full 70-step moving checklist</li>
          <li>Suburb Finder — compare any suburb</li>
          <li>Unlimited blog &amp; article access</li>
          <li>Weekly newsletter — policy updates</li>
          <li>Priority email Q&amp;A</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-block btn-lg">Start for $1.99/month →</a>
        <p class="price-note">Secured by Stripe · Cancel anytime</p>
      </div>

      <!-- GUIDES ONLY -->
      <div class="price-card reveal d3">
        <p class="price-tier">Guides Only</p>
        <p class="price-amount" style="font-size:1.35rem; padding-top: 4px;">$19 – $27</p>
        <p class="price-cadence">one-time purchase per guide</p>
        <p class="price-desc">Don't want a subscription? Buy exactly the guide you need, keep it forever.</p>
        <ul class="price-includes">
          <li>Kiwi Masterguide — $27</li>
          <li>Tax &amp; Finance Guide — $22</li>
          <li>Australian Jobs Guide — $19</li>
          <li>Instant PDF download</li>
          <li>Yours to keep, no expiry</li>
          <li class="dim">Suburb Finder</li>
          <li class="dim">Newsletter &amp; updates</li>
          <li class="dim">Priority Q&amp;A</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/guides" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block">Buy individual guides →</a>
        <p class="price-note">One-off payment, no recurring charge</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURE COMPARISON TABLE -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="shell">
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <p class="sec-eye">Compare plans</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h2">Everything side by side</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-wrap">
      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th>Free</th>
            <th>Full Access — $1.99/mo</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Visa Checker</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Basic</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Full results</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Moving Checklist</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> 20 steps</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> 70 steps</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Blog articles</td>
            <td>3 per month</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Unlimited</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Kiwi Masterguide PDF</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Tax &amp; Finance Guide PDF</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Australian Jobs Guide PDF</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Suburb Finder</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Weekly newsletter</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Priority email Q&amp;A</td>
            <td><span class="check-no">–</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span> Included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Cost Calculator</td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="check-yes">✓</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top: 24px;">
      <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Full Access for $1.99/month →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 36px;">
      <p class="sec-eye">What Kiwis say</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h2">Trusted by 12,400+ people</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      <div class="review reveal d1">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"The $1.99 subscription is an absolute no-brainer. The Tax &amp; Finance guide alone saved me from a massive IRD headache — I had no idea double taxation worked the way it does."</p>
        <p class="reviewer">Jess T. <span>— Moved to Melbourne, 2024</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="review reveal d2">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"I tried to find this information on the Australian Government site for weeks. GoAustralia had it all explained in plain English in about five minutes. Worth every cent."</p>
        <p class="reviewer">Mark R. <span>— Moved to Brisbane, 2023</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="review reveal d3">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"The suburb finder helped us choose between Manly and Cronulla before we even landed. We knew exactly what the commute, cost and vibe would be like. Saved so much stress."</p>
        <p class="reviewer">Sophie &amp; Dan W. <span>— Moved to Sydney, 2024</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-eye">Common questions</p>
        <h2 class="sec-h2">FAQ</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Can't find the answer you need? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@goaustralia.co.nz" style="color:var(--blue);">hello@goaustralia.co.nz</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>What's included in Full Access?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">Full Access gives you all three PDF guides (Kiwi Masterguide, Tax &amp; Finance, Australian Jobs), the complete 70-step moving checklist, the Suburb Finder tool, unlimited blog access, a weekly newsletter with policy updates, and priority email Q&amp;A support. Everything is updated weekly.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">Yes, absolutely. There's no lock-in contract. You can cancel your subscription at any time from your account dashboard and you won't be charged again. You'll keep access until the end of the billing period you've already paid for.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is this the official Australian Government site?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">No. GoAustralia.co.nz is an independent resource operated by Kiwis who have made the move themselves. We're not affiliated with the Australian or New Zealand government. We translate complex government policy into plain English. Always verify important decisions with official sources at homeaffairs.gov.au.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What's the difference between Full Access and buying a guide?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">The individual guides are a one-time purchase — great if you just need one specific document. Full Access ($1.99/month) includes all three guides plus the live tools (Suburb Finder, full checklist), the newsletter, and email support. If you're actively planning a move, Full Access is far better value.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>Ready to make the move?</h2>
    <p>Join 12,400+ Kiwis who planned their move with GoAustralia. $1.99/month, cancel anytime.</p>
    <a href="/signup" class="cta-band-btn">Start for $1.99/month →</a>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
